message: >-
  Please cite Dugongue's coordinated-frame and entrance-bank construction,
  its individual dependencies, this project and the upstream manuscript.
  Project-level authorship identifies the maintainer, not sole authorship
  of the community result. See CONTRIBUTORS.md and the frozen notices.
title: "A sharper exponent for integer multiplication"
authors:
  - family-names: Colkitt
    given-names: Douglas
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
version: "community-entrance-banks-2026-10-09"
date-released: 2026-10-09
repository-code: "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds"
url: "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds"
abstract: >-
  Community research on integer multiplication with conditional kappa =
  330942774629799/500000000000000000 = 0.000661885549259598. Dugongue's
  coordinated-frame and completed-entrance-bank construction builds on
  chafreaky's shared-edge complex supplier and eumemic's physical bit word,
  retaining the cumulative paired-cube, carrier, shared-core and assembly
  lineage. A maintainer supplement supplies the bank scheduling argument.
  Retained OpenAI #109 analytic, uniform-recursion and fixed-tape interfaces
  remain assumed. Finite checks and written review are not a formal proof
  of multiplication or independent human peer review.
